gainst criminal gangs in an exciting procedurally-generated action movie FPS. Join forces with a friend, online or locally, and take down those crooks in true buddy-cop style!<br><br>As a part of the RICO task force, your mission is clear: get in, take down the criminals and get out again. Sounds easy, but it's not - procedurally-generated cases mean you'll never know who or what's waiting for you. Pick your load-out, then use the element of surprise to get a tactical edge over the enemy. Unlock new weapons, mission types and traits, or dive into Daily Play and see how high you can climb the cop rankings! <br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Take down criminal gangs with extreme prejudice and solve the RICO case - you've only got 24 hours, detective!<br></li><li>Procedurally-generated cases mean no two games are ever the same - you'll never know what's waiting for you.<br></li><li>Crack cases with a friend, either online or locally, for co-op carnage. Two loose cannons are always better than one!<br></li><li>Daily Play cases - with leaderboards and rewards - keep you coming back for more, along with unlockable weapons, traits and mission types to discover.</li></ul>","developers":["Ground Shatter"],"dlc":[1177830],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/656700/header.jpg?t=1721300854","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2019 Ground Shatter Ltd. Licensed to and published by Rising Star Games Ltd.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/656700/213459/f12b6c9ef7db1e3005104d5339ee8159d1cb58a9/1751126950/dash_av1.mpd?t=1552645379","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/656700/213459/f12b6c9ef7db1e3005104d5339ee8159d1cb58a9/1751126950/dash_h264.mpd?t=1552645379","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/656700